  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Satyajit Nath vs The State Of West Bengal And Another on 7 August, 2023",
    "facts": "Petitioner is directed to serve a copy of the revisional application upon Mr. Imran Ali, learned advocate, who ordinarily appears on behalf of the State. The subject matter of the case relates to Sections 51 and 59 of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006 pending in the court of learned CJM, Purba Bardhaman. Learned advocate for the petitioner submits that the petitioner is a General Manager of a company, namely, Red Cow Private Limited. The subject matter of the case is under Section 77 of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006 and is barred under law. However, the petitioner submits that the petitioner have challenged the initial analyst report so submitted before the concerned court.",
